<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέμν-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bottom of the trunk of a tree,
				stump</i>: generally, <i>stem, trunk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				238
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				267
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				7.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.13
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>enlarged bark</i> of the stem of the olive, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.8.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>base</i> or <i>bottom</i> of a pillar, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέμνα χθόνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					88.4
				</span></i>
			; of a <i>trunk</i> artery, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.189
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				659
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέμνον πράγματος πελωρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					321
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρετῆς π.</span> the
			<i>trunk</i> of the tree Virtue, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				14.197
			</span></i>; of a woman, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀρετῆς πινυτὴν .
				. πρέμνον</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				416
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Alexandria</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
